&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;(Network Growth &amp;amp; Performance)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;Experience with health-plan network development, provider contracting, network economics, or network adequacy.&lt;/li&gt;
